<Layout lang="en" title="Affiliate Disclosure — Pip24h" description="Pip24h's affiliate relationship disclosure.">
	<article class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
		<h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
		<p><em>Last updated: August 11, 2026</em></p>

		<p>
			Pip24h is an independent review site supported through affiliate links. This means that when you click
			certain links on this site (e.g. an "Open Account" button) and sign up with the linked broker, we
			<strong>may earn a commission</strong> from that broker. This comes at <strong>no extra cost to you</strong>.
		</p>

		<h2>Does this affect our reviews?</h2>
		<p>
			We aim to keep our reviews and rankings objective, based on criteria such as trading fees, trustworthiness,
			withdrawal speed, and platform experience. Whether or not a broker has an affiliate program does not change
			our actual assessment of it.
		</p>

		<h2>Why do we use this model?</h2>
		<p>
			The affiliate model lets Pip24h stay free for readers, without needing to charge for access or rely on
			intrusive advertising.
		</p>

		<p>If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships, please contact us via the email listed on the site.</p>
	</article>
</Layout>
